    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="49.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 49.3</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon nime æfesne on swynum: æt þryfingrum þæt ðridde, æt twyfingrum þæt feorðe, æt þymelum þæt fifte.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If [rent] for pasturage is paid in pigs: [if the bacon is] three-fingers thick, [let it be] every third [pig], at two-fingers, every fourth, at [the width of] a thumb, every fifth.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If pannage is paid in pigs', every third pig shall be taken when the bacon is three fingers thick, every fourth when the bacon is two fingers thick, and every fifth when it is a thumb thick.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif mon nime æbesne on swinum: æt þry fingrum ðæt ðridde, æt twy fingrum ðæt feorþe, æt ðymelum ðæt fifte.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
